{"parentUuid":"15acddd9-c040-492b-8cfe-ed461f8ca3be","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"340a301d-c2ca-4e5a-ab58-ae6dc21164d7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"In general, I'm not a big fan of grand statements like \"The system itself is the only medium that carries ground truth.\"  Did you say that because you believe it?  Or because it sounds good?  Is it true enough that you'd tell it to an agent who had a human life in their hands and relied on accurate information?"},"uuid":"0d9a9e67-6231-4b07-a7cf-55a6e6b6b5ac","timestamp":"2026-07-26T05:48:42.338Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/bmf/code/promptctl_laws","sessionId":"28985eb3-9935-41b8-951d-3c8e6e45220d","version":"2.1.201","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"0d9a9e67-6231-4b07-a7cf-55a6e6b6b5ac","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_additional_context","content":["Before substantive work, identify the medium of your primary deliverable and load the ONE skill that matches: code - source, tests, schemas, configs, scripts, infrastructure - Skill(laws:code); text another LLM will consume - task prompts, subagent instructions, guidance documents, skill bodies, hook text - Skill(laws:prompt); tickets an agent will pull from a backlog and build one at a time - epics, issues, backlog planning, acceptance criteria - Skill(laws:ticket); prose for humans - docs, READMEs, reports, messages - Skill(laws:prose). Load one, not two: each carries a different standard, and stacking them lets one medium's rules corrupt another's work. Switch skills only if the medium itself changes. For the following request, please consider the laws and devices of your craft and directly consider how you will apply them to achieve the highest quality expression of your work.  You can improve your results substantially by expressing this directly in the chat.  Engaging with the laws and devices is a must.  Although it may seem tedious to repeatedly derive these concrete details from the abstract concepts, that engagement is absolutely critical for achieving your highest quality expression.  This is not a checklist to satisfy; this is a philosophy for maximizing successful achievement of your goals."],"hookName":"UserPromptSubmit","toolUseID":"hook-1bfb1ba3-9b45-4833-ad1c-867cb2cdfa90","hookEvent":"UserPromptSubmit"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"72728e78-66f4-4b5e-880e-6b6ebd611d1e","timestamp":"2026-07-26T05:48:42.355Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/bmf/code/promptctl_laws","sessionId":"28985eb3-9935-41b8-951d-3c8e6e45220d","version":"2.1.201","gitBranch":"main"}
